        {
          "id": "01cfecb0-da14-46a4-848d-0b87106478d9",
          "name": "Search Carriers (OpenSearch)",
          "request": {
            "name": "Search Carriers (OpenSearch)",
            "description": {
              "content": "\nExecute an OpenSearch query against the carrier index.\n\nThis is faster than /match as it bypasses embeddings. The agent constructs\nthe query directly using OpenSearch Query DSL.\n\n**Example - Fuzzy name search**:\n```json\n{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"bool\": {\n      \"must\": [\n        {\"match\": {\"name\": {\"query\": \"Liberty Mutual\", \"fuzziness\": \"AUTO\"}}}\n      ],\n      \"filter\": [\n        {\"term\": {\"is_active\": true}}\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"size\": 10\n}\n```\n\n**Example - Exact state filter**:\n```json\n{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"bool\": {\n      \"must\": [{\"match\": {\"name\": \"Chubb\"}}],\n      \"filter\": [{\"term\": {\"mailing_address_state\": \"NY\"}}]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Index Fields**:\n- `name` (text, boosted): Carrier name\n- `is_active` (boolean): Active status\n- `mailing_address_state` (keyword): State code\n\n**Limits**: size max 100\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "broker",
                "agent",
                "carriers",
                "search"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "<object>",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "id": "63e42dc1-58cf-4359-ac2e-a958aa01ce2b",
              "name": "Search results",
              "originalRequest": {
                "url": {
                  "path": [
                    "v2",
                    "broker",
                    "agent",
                    "carriers",
                    "search"
                  ],
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "query": [],
                  "variable": []
                },
                "header": [
                  {
                    "description": {
                      "content": "Added as a part of security scheme: apikey",
                      "type": "text/plain"
                    },
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "<API Key>"
                  }
                ],
                "method": "POST",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"bool\": {\n      \"must\": [\n        {\n          \"match\": {\n            \"name\": {\n              \"query\": \"Liberty\",\n              \"fuzziness\": \"AUTO\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"filter\": [\n        {\n          \"term\": {\n            \"is_active\": true\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"size\": 10\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "text/plain"
                }
              ],
