        {
          "id": "c1db41ca-f936-4c56-9ffb-fe259a65aca4",
          "name": "Search Coverage Types (OpenSearch)",
          "request": {
            "name": "Search Coverage Types (OpenSearch)",
            "description": {
              "content": "\nExecute an OpenSearch query against the coverage type (ProductLine) index.\n\n**Example - Name search**:\n```json\n{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"bool\": {\n      \"must\": [{\"match\": {\"display_name\": {\"query\": \"Cyber\", \"fuzziness\": \"AUTO\"}}}],\n      \"filter\": [{\"term\": {\"is_active\": true}}]\n    }\n  },\n  \"size\": 10\n}\n```\n\n**Example - Exact code match**:\n```json\n{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"term\": {\"code\": \"CYBER\"}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Index Fields**:\n- `display_name` (text, boosted): Display name (e.g., \"Cyber Liability\")\n- `code` (keyword): Code for exact match (e.g., \"CYBER\", \"GL\")\n- `description` (text): Description\n- `is_active` (boolean): Active status\n- `is_core` (boolean): Core coverage type flag\n\n**Limits**: size max 100\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "broker",
                "agent",
                "coverage-types",
                "search"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
