        {
          "id": "cdba084b-9596-406b-975a-01a86c12cd29",
          "name": "Search Wholesalers/MGAs (OpenSearch)",
          "request": {
            "name": "Search Wholesalers/MGAs (OpenSearch)",
            "description": {
              "content": "\nExecute an OpenSearch query against the wholesaler index.\n\nThis endpoint searches both wholesalers AND MGAs (same model).\nThe agent determines from context whether to use the ID as wholesaler_id or mga_id.\n\n**Example - Name search**:\n```json\n{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"bool\": {\n      \"must\": [{\"match\": {\"name\": {\"query\": \"CRC Insurance\", \"fuzziness\": \"AUTO\"}}}],\n      \"filter\": [{\"term\": {\"is_active\": true}}]\n    }\n  },\n  \"size\": 10\n}\n```\n\n**Index Fields**:\n- `name` (text, boosted): Wholesaler/MGA name\n- `is_active` (boolean): Active status\n- `mailing_address_city` (keyword): City\n- `mailing_address_state` (keyword): State code\n- `ascend_identifier` (keyword): Ascend ID for exact match\n\n**Limits**: size max 100\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "broker",
                "agent",
                "wholesalers",
                "search"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
